@suppress_minorities_
title: Cultural Cleansing
subtitle: Enact policies to suppress sexual minorities and degenerate art.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and nsdap_in_government and conservative_coalition >= 50
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? [? if not nsdap_in_government : The NSDAP is not currently in government. ?][? if conservative_coalition < 50 : We do not have the votes from our right-wing partners to enact these decrees. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; cultural_reaction_timer -= 11; last_advisor_action = 1; liberal_dissent += 15
go-to: cultural_purges

We have initiated a harsh crackdown on cosmopolitan centers and progressive institutes, systematically purging what we deem "degenerate art" from public view.

